cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its teaching materials, please cite it as below."
title: "读者评论 → 桥段热度与情绪地图 / Book Review Emotion Map: aligning reader quotes to passages of public-domain novels"
abstract: "A teaching demo that treats the sentences readers quote in book reviews as free annotations: quotes are aligned back to the source text of three public-domain novels (5-gram shingles plus fuzzy matching, embeddings for plot mentions), mention counts are corrected for position bias (observed/expected with empirical-Bayes shrinkage), and the result is shown as an auto-playing heat-emotion timeline. Only aggregate statistics are published; no review text. Part of the AI Teaching Demos series."
type: software
